Litigation hold (LEG-HOLD-06)

Issuer: Advokátska kancelária Hoferová & Bartoš s. r. o. · IČO 51 234 567 · Laurinská 12, 811 01 Bratislava

When litigation or an inspection is reasonably anticipated, issue a written hold to the custodians within 24 hours.
Suspend automatic deletion for mail, chat and device backups within the scope of the hold.
Custodians confirm the hold in writing; the matter lead keeps the acknowledgements in the file.
Destroying or altering evidence once proceedings are foreseeable exposes the client to liability for obstruction under the Criminal Code (zákon č. 300/2005 Z. z.).
Court deadlines run from delivery to the electronic mailbox under zákon č. 305/2013 Z. z., so the hold notice also names the person monitoring that mailbox.
Releasing a hold needs sign-off from the matter lead and from counsel responsible for disclosure.

